(7734587, 1274703, 122128, '<td valign="top">very nice photo Kobi ,congratulation for the ribbon and thank you for your comment on my photo :-)</td>', 'very nice photo Kobi ,congratulation for the ribbon and thank you for your comment on my photo :-)', '2022-12-14 15:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734759, 1274784, 29535, '<td valign="top">What I love about this is that despite the simple subject you came up with a concept that fit the bill and executed it perfectly, with a competent shot. ''Boring'' you may say but it is a perfectly taken shot that fits the challenge, so for that alone for me it has to be at least a 6!</td>', 'What I love about this is that despite the simple subject you came up with a concept that fit the bill and executed it perfectly, with a competent shot. ''Boring'' you may say but it is a perfectly taken shot that fits the challenge, so for that alone for me it has to be at least a 6!', '2022-12-16 13:09:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734760, 1274643, 29535, '<td valign="top">This did not deserve to finish bottom, and whilst I didn''t rate it too highly the subject is good. I feel it''s the composition that let it down, far too close. And then when the eye wanders the horizon is off. Try revisiting the scene if possible and either completely obscuring the background using an f2.8 or similar or composing in a way that isolates the flower more.</td>', 'This did not deserve to finish bottom, and whilst I didn''t rate it too highly the subject is good. I feel it''s the composition that let it down, far too close. And then when the eye wanders the horizon is off. Try revisiting the scene if possible and either completely obscuring the background using an f2.8 or similar or composing in a way that isolates the flower more.', '2022-12-16 13:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734890, 1274641, 29535, '<td valign="top">Hi Rucl1124!<br/> <br/>Good job on hitting the nail on the head for the contest again, with an out of the box idea. Fire is notoriously difficult to photograph, and as in your last image the camera is struggling with the lack of light at the edges and perhaps too much zoom.<br/> <br/>I would have preferred the two people on the right to be more centred, or not there at all. In the former case it could have been cool if they were watching the fire as spectators. Is this a controlled bonfire for a festival or similar?<br/> <br/>Good luck on the next contest!</td>', 'Hi Rucl1124! Good job on hitting the nail on the head for the contest again, with an out of the box idea. Fire is notoriously difficult to photograph, and as in your last image the camera is struggling with the lack of light at the edges and perhaps too much zoom. I would have preferred the two people on the right to be more centred, or not there at all. In the former case it could have been cool if they were watching the fire as spectators. Is this a controlled bonfire for a festival or similar? Good luck on the next contest!', '2022-12-18 13:16:34.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
